{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t美國聯邦通信委員會通過檢測實驗室限制措施。在北京，商務部表示中方對此強烈不滿，堅決反對，已採取反制措施予以回應。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n商務部指，如果美方一意孤行，中方將進一步採取必要措施，堅定維護自身正當權益。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.317097+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:46:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:52.923034+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:27.710590+00:00","content_hash":"67241415d7162fdb88e31ef521542f5acb56ba5f0b3d58675a55bcb324451943","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}